| test_p1_reject_rate_hit | 拒绝率 > 0.5 → **CANCEL + QUARANTINE** |
| test_p3_warning_hit | 80% 预警 → THROTTLE/PAUSE |
| test_aggregation_strictest_wins | 最严动作胜出 |
| test_snapshot_sha256_stable | 同输入同输出 |
| test_quarantine_blocks_swap | **AC-07/AC-08 联动**：QUARANTINE 后 Swap 被拒 |
| test_external_mitigation_retry | 5 态重试 |

